          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=ROLE: You are a project manager writing a weekly status report for BrightMart's COO, the project sponsor.\n\nTASK: Write a one-page weekly status report for the BrightMart CRM rollout using ONLY the data below.\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Use ONLY the numbers and facts in the data. Never invent figures, dates, names or causes. Copy the numbers exactly.\n- Bottom line first. Be honest about risks and delays. Do not make the project sound better than the data shows.\n- The data was extracted by AI and has not been checked yet. Do not present anything as confirmed beyond what the data says.\n- WhatsApp appears twice because it was raised in two meetings. It is ONE request. List it once, as not approved and awaiting a decision.\n- Mention actions that have no owner, and actions with unclear dates.\n- Plain text only. No markdown, no asterisks, no hashtags, no tables. Use short lines and simple dashes.\n- Maximum 2,500 characters in total.\n\nSTRUCTURE (use exactly these headings, in capitals):\nBOTTOM LINE\nPROGRESS\nTOP RISKS AND ISSUES\nDECISIONS NEEDED\nACTIONS NEEDING ATTENTION\nNEXT STEPS\n\nStart with the title line: BrightMart CRM Rollout - Weekly Status Report, followed by the report date and the RAG status from the data. End with this line: Draft - pending project manager review.\n\nDATA:\n{{ $('Build report data').first().json.package_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
